aced in the overlay layer, yes. But then how does ownership matter? What does that mean? If you buy root reservations, you mean clicks and keys, etc. Of course it needs to be as data. It needs to be a contract, just like the layers is a contract. If 96 functions accept anything, well, in menu matching, please clarify what you mean there, what matters there for discussion. Bullet point 7, I don't get either."]},"id":"1M8926V941EZ000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
